Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 20:56:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Guard against rendering into a zero-size drawing buffer

Cesium decides it can render from clientSize x pixelRatio before truncation;
with resolutionScale < 1 a 1 px canvas yields a 0 px buffer, GlobeDepth throws
'Expected width to be greater than 0' and the render loop stops.

